<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This file contains a script designed for ultra light fishing in Russian Fishing 4.
The script is designed to automatically fish for 200 repetitions with ultra light setup and a retrieval speed of 30.
The script can be manipulated for heavier setups and other retrievals by changing the different delays in the script.

Important notes:
- Set the drag to max allowed by your setup.
- All fish are kept in the keepnet.
- Make sure the keybinds are the standard fro RF4.

Enjoy</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>Delay 64 ms
LeftDown 1
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyUp 225 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 3000 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 25000 ms
RightDown 1
KeyDown 225 1
Delay 5000 ms
KeyUp 225 1
RightUp 1
LeftUp 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 500 ms
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 200</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Russian Fishing 4</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>